  "slug": "first-article-change-request-form",
  "title": "First Article Change Request Form",
  "subtitle": "Compare current and proposed first article controls, assess affected work, predefine evidence, authorize a transition boundary, implement, and verify results.",
  "description": "A controlled first article change request form for changing the first article build and inspection without losing revision traceability, impact ownership, pre-implementation evidence, transition control, rollback readiness, post-change verification, or receiving handoff.",
  "use_case": "Use before altering the drawing, specification, purchase order, and approved process configuration or its execution when the proposed state must be assessed, approved, introduced at a clear effective boundary, and verified before closeout.",
  "risk_tier": "A",
